<title>BELGIUM: PetroFina discovers oil offshore Vietnam.</title>
<headline>PetroFina discovers oil offshore Vietnam.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian oil and gas group PetroFina SA said on Friday a joint venture controlled by its  Fina Exploration unit had discovered oil in an offshore test well near Vietnam.</p>
<p>&quot;The (test well) flowed at a rate of 5,400 barrels per day of 38 API oil,&quot; PetroFina said in a statement.</p>
</text>
